                <head>Tab B</head>
                <p>II. U.S. Aid Extended through Multilateral Organizations</p>
                <p>Includes contributions to the UN, International
                    Development Association, IBRD, Asian
                    Development Bank, International Financial Corporation &amp; Inter-American
                    Development Bank. A breakdown by agency is available only through FY 1970 except as footnoted.</p>
